</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 588)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The built-in manual is brought up to date</b> (Help ▸ Asobi Manual). It now covers the colour helper ("Check This File's Colour…"), optimized media, delivering a session over a link, drag-to-reorder, the floating and resizable filmstrip, the right-click menu on the picture, and the latest web-review features — with new figures for the colour helper and the filmstrip. A complete <b>Reviewer Guide</b> is included too, so you can read exactly what your invited guests read.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
